{{#if @site.members_enabled}}{{#unless @member}}<section id="membership" class="membership-tiers flexy column">
    <hgroup class="flexy column">
        <h2 id="start-your-story-with-us">Start your story with us</h2>
        <p>Whether you would love to stay connected or receive our monthly heritage boxes, there is a perfect way to join the {{@site.title}} community.</p>
    </hgroup>
    {{#get "tiers" include="monthly_price,yearly_price,benefits" limit="100" as |tiers|}}<div class="flexy">
        {{!--
        
🌿 Free Plan

Stay part of our community — at no cost.

Includes:

Monthly newsletter with recipes & stories

Early access to limited products

Invitations to community events

Access to our story-driven blog

Special seasonal announcements

===============

🌺 AbuEin Plan

Aunty Suzy’s kitchen was the heart of our home — where jars of pickles sat by the window and embroidery came to life by candlelight. Every box carries a piece of that memory.

What’s Inside the Monthly Box?

Every month, enjoy 7–9 curated items celebrating Palestinian heritage:

🥒 Preserved Foods

🌿 Spices & Herbs

🧵 Embroidered Pieces

🎨 Art & Prints

📖 Stories & Recipes

🎁 Seasonal Surprises

        --}}
        {{#foreach tiers}}<article class="flexy column">
            <hgroup class="flexy column">
                <h3>{{name}}</h3>
                <p>{{description}}</p>
            </hgroup>
            
            {{#if benefits}}<ul>
                {{#foreach benefits as |benefit|}}<li>{{benefit}}</li>{{/foreach}}
            {{/if}}</ul>

            <div>
                <p>Price: {{price plan}}</p>
            </div>
            {{#if monthly_price}}<div>
                <a href="javascript:void(0);" title="Monthly plan" data-portal="signup/{{id}}/monthly">Monthly plan &mdash; {{price monthly_price currency=currency}}</a>
            </div>{{/if}}
            {{#if yearly_price}}<div>
                <a href="javascript:void(0);" title="Yearly plan" data-portal="signup/{{id}}/yearly">Yearly plan &mdash; {{price yearly_price currency=currency}}</a>
            </div>{{/if}}
        </article>{{/foreach}}
    </div>{{/get}}
    <footer class="flexy column">
        <h4>What's In The Monthly Box?</h4>
        <p>Each month, we curate 7-9 items celebrating Palestinian heritage and seasonal abundance:</p>
        <ul class="flexy">
            <li>
                <div>🥒</div>
                <p>Preserved Foods</p>
            </li>
            <li>
                <div>🌿</div>
                <p>Spices & Herbs</p>
            </li>
            <li>
                <div>🧵</div>
                <p>Embroideries Pieces</p>
            </li>
            <li>
                <div class="emoji">🎨</div>
                <p>Art & Prints</p>
            </li>
            <li>
                <div>📖</div>
                <p>Stories & Recipes</p>
            </li>
            <li>
                <div>🎁</div>
                <p>Seasonal Surprises</p>
            </li>
        </ul>
        <p><small>Already have an account? <a href="#/portal/signin" title="Sign in" data-portal="signin">Sign in</a></small></p>
    </footer>
</section>{{/unless}}{{else}}<p>Membership is disabled&period;</p>{{/if}}